; Twenty nested prompts, each from its own task, quit in a scrambled
; order: every read raises a quit, and the buffer and the layout end as
; they began.
> (define before (datums layout:buffer))
> (define tasks (map (lambda (i) (start! (lambda () (minibuffer:read (format "Q~a: " i))))) (iota 20)))
